Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every\Nwall that's in our wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up. Way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rubbed up to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up. Our wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain within, I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly,\Nbut I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom, I will keep in mind,\NI'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up,\Nsing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up, raise up\Nthe flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up, we'll get past\Neveryone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.34,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if waves are\Nrough, jump through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on towards our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In another five minutes, the entire\Nbuilding will be filled with lethal gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The survivors are frantically making their\Nway through the lab toward building R.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At the last remaining exit, door R-66.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the ceiling's falling in on us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas is seeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to building R.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone move, but I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:02:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is no\Ntime to wuss out, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you beat the bird woman, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they coming from that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to stay behind\Nto cover our escape, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The G5 is headed straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we were going in the\Nwrong direction, you stubborn jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it and just put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing carrying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,her over your shoulder\Nlike a sack of flour?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this way. Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, everybody! Run faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay or we're gonna get crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done all I can for now anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Head straight for building our arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get you out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Neat breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't supposed\Nto win this round, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're proud of\Nthe upset you pulled off,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're going to regret\Nwhat you've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know as much about\NJoker's past as you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're going to pay with\Nyour life for that ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Upstarts like you get a touch of fame\Nand think they can take over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but they couldn't be more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's always someone stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too weak to win, right, Smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You runs have energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But energy is enough to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your breath worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your own problems to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This room's gonna explode soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Vergo the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one man\Nwho could have done this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be law why isn't\NVergo doing something
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,please master tell us\Nwhat's going on we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,men buried under the\Nrecord master curse it all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,this laboratory is my\Nparadise and it's crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to pieces thanks to you the\Ncrew i hope they're okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,our built-in floor two hey can you hear me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,secret room come in do\Nyou read me yes master
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,will you please tell us what just happened
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,open the air vents on\Nthe first floor at once
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,well what are you waiting\Nfor you heard me i
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,want the land of the dead\Nto flow into this room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but the gas is lethal i'm made of gas\Nit's not going to hurt me right roger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that we'll just evacuate the soldiers\Nfrom the first floor i said do it now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,is there a problem do i need to define\Nthe word now for you stop making
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,excuses and do as i tell you but master\Nthere are over a hundred of our people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,down there do i look like a give a\Ndamn you fools are nothing but guinea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,pigs a hundred of you could die and\Nnobody would even notice you were gone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone care you're the dregs of\Nsociety what are you doing can't you hear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,me it doesn't matter how many of you\Ni lose you're all easily replaceable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that's gotta hurt for them seeing\Ncaesar's true colors the others
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the gas is going to get them any second i\Nwonder could i control the doors from here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:07:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,something wrong hey i'm\Nasking you huh no no sir
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,hey wait i get it now\Nuh-huh the master must
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,be trying to fool straw\Nhat it's all a show Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he has a plan to\Ndeal with the gas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't just let our people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master's such a sensitive guy, you\Nwould hurt him if we knew we suspected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I opened the vents for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas is leaking in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have done what\NI said from the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to follow orders, not think!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, flow into me, land of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my full strength,\Nthe true power of science!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you strong enough to\Nface the power of science?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been a very useful demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already had two\Ncountries express interest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,in acquiring the land of the dead from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Countries that are normally peaceful but\Nafter learning a weapon like this existed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,they realized they needed to protect\Nthemselves by whatever means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My expertise will be in\Nhigh demand soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fill the world with weapons\NI created and when that's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,as the king of the land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he? Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Low-life guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My deadly creation works\Nso well, it amazes even me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutting down the nervous\Nsystem almost instantaneously!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's art as well as science!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How can one man possess such power?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those poor people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you look after Brownbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, going to turn, tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and run after all—it isn't\Ngoing to do you any good though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when the land of the\Ndead is practically filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Building B—there's nowhere left to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire island is a death trap now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know you're brokenhearted and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but can I take a look at\Nthat control panel for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are down there, and\NI'm not gonna let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk—you watched the\Nwhole time didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill him, kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the one who gassed your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We trusted the master for years and\Nhe betrayed us in the worst way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't learn the truth\Ntill it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole island's toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You people are just as\Ndead as we are though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And your captain stabbed you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see him run from Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He took off like a coward and\Nleft the rest of you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard you insult my captain\Nright in front of me. Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,if he were the type of person who would\Nturn tail without a second thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,things would probably be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many times I would\Nhave run if it was up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:11:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now third gear but no matter what\Nwe're up against, he never hesitates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He never stops believing in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have no choice but\Nto believe in him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've pledged to live up to his\Nexpectations as long as we breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar may be strong
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's the kind of person\Nthat Luffy hates the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can make
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar pay, it's Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,caesar pay it's luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish you now, so I\Nnever see you again! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, let's make a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can walk under me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down for a second intolerantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:11:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he calls this an experiment well\Nit's a disaster after this he's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,done for inform mama too sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ah my old joker what's next call
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,jack he'll handle things that's\Na kind of what i was afraid of i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,see an alliance this is quite a\Npain well we can't allow this can we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uppy! Uppy! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Usopp's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep heading straight for\Nnow, then go down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the easiest way to get\Nto the R Building from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to close the shutters before\Nthe gas gets in, so make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Topper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kin'emon! Just look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas came and then this happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's as sad as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tragedy struck when we were evacuating\Nthe children from the exam room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We were searching for\NKinemon's lost son, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran into a young girl who knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She said something odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke has taken the form of a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that the dragon\Nwe sliced up earlier could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the vilest monster that ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be easily seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That area is surely\Nfilled with dust by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! There it is! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We must turn around at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior spirit will guide\Nhim through any obstacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,be it deadly gas or a blazing fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vumanosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior spirit or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, you're here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what happened\Nto Brownie? Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah he should be fine\Nwell actually I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,there see I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,told you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,worry about the kids they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,be fine my friends are on\Ntheir way to help and they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,always keep their word just\Nworry about yourself for now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta see Nami again,\Nand you're holding me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He slowed down earlier to get first aid\Nto that girl, and that's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need this. It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They use this cart to haul S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we can use it to halt\Npeople and this whole lab is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy, Smoky, where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoky
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoky, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reporting when I'm\Ndone crying. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, where did Caesar go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, see that hole there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I blew him straight that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Door kind of got busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the plan was to\Nkidnap him. Why? He sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we should just leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not what we both agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.62,0:16:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If he escapes from here the\Nplan is ruined. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done good riddance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The point of having a plan is\Nto follow through with it I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,should have known better than\Nto trust you with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to get him back now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A short time ago, a strange sight could\Nbe seen in the skies near Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did the Straw Hats\Nknow what they were in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this mission is over then I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you, Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So cruel, it wasn't enough\Nto blow up my dear fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You had to burn his whole town to ash too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He did you no wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How many men must you kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I get engaged, blow\Nmy darling to little bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight men and eight towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't he let me be happy? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how he shows his love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks of you like his little\Nsister, that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Him blowing up a town or two is\Njust a sign of how much he cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this only happens because you\Nhaven't learned how to say no to those chums.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And what made him a chump?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I turn my back on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here's the deal, just cuz\Nsomeone asks—you don't gotta say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need 50 newspaper\Nsubscriptions; no one does,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and stop lending out all of your money—we're\Nwasting it on crap you don't need,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How much debt do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 98 million—that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is none of your\Nbusiness, if you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,business if you're Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say two mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, can I pay you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're done, I needed to go gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we finish our mission, I'll\Ntake out a new loan for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker needed me to carry this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Honk Hazard, straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's gas is covering the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I shoot it, will that help any?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Hop off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's typhoon time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Storm God! Matagamuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, Monet, and Vergo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure can't wait to spend\Nall your money at the casino!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did one of the tanks just explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, something went flying into the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not something, someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffalo, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like something\Nwent down before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We just saw Master Caesar,\Nbut he was all busted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He went flying out of the\Nlab and into the tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like someone kicked his ass hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what state he's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab Caesar immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there and\Nbring him to dress Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But Monet and Vanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of damn rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow up the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than that to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have him, I can\Nmake all the S .A .D. I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's someone down on the\Ndeck, but that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, not with all that gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure it's not just some\Ndead body or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's what messed up looking bird.
